.*
.* The problem log: WRKPRB, its options (DSPPRB's details, Work with
.* Problem, Enter text) and ANZPRB's guided analysis. No pub400 golden:
.* pub400 refuses the commands; ours are under ui/uim/tests/golden/service.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SELCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NOTECL BASETYPE='CHAR 70'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SYMPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 60'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SHORTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=YNCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=SELCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBTYPE CLASS=YNCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSEV CLASS=YNCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBREF CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBRSRC CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSYS CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBODATE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBOTIME CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBCDATE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBCTIME CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBASGN CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSYMP CLASS=SYMPCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBRPT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=NOTE CLASS=NOTECL.
:VAR NAME=NEWNOTE CLASS=NOTECL.
:VAR NAME=ANZMSGID CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=ANZOBJ CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=ANZSTOP CLASS=YNCL.
:VAR NAME=ANZTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=PRBS VARS='OPT PRBID PRBSTS PRBTEXT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=NOTES VARS='NOTE'.
:KEYL NAME=PBKEYS HELP='KEYS/PBKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Report prepared problems
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSKEYS HELP='KEYS/DSKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=MNKEYS HELP='KEYS/MNKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPRB KEYL=PBKEYS HELP=WRKPRB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Problems
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PRBS.(No problems logged)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2' HELP='WRKPRB/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4' HELP='WRKPRB/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5' HELP='WRKPRB/OPTIONS'.5=Display details
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 6' HELP='WRKPRB/OPTIONS'.6=Print details
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8' HELP='WRKPRB/OPTIONS'.8=Work with problem
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 9' HELP='WRKPRB/OPTIONS'.9=Work with alerts
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ENTER='RETURN 12' HELP='WRKPRB/OPTIONS'.12=Enter text
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKPRB/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBID'.Problem ID
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBTEXT'.Problem Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPPRB KEYL=DSKEYS HELP=DSPPRB ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Problem Details
:DATA DEPTH=15.
:DATAI VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBID'.Problem ID
:DATAI VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBSTS'.Status
:DATAI VAR=PRBTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBTYPE'.Problem type
:DATAI VAR=PRBSEV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBSEV'.Severity
:DATAI VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBTEXT'.Description
:DATAI VAR=PRBREF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBREF'.Reference code
:DATAI VAR=PRBRSRC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBRSRC'.Resource name
:DATAI VAR=PRBSYS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBSYS'.Origin system
:DATAI VAR=PRBODATE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBODATE'.Date opened
:DATAI VAR=PRBOTIME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBOTIME'.Time opened
:DATAI VAR=PRBCDATE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBCDATE'.Date last changed
:DATAI VAR=PRBCTIME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBCTIME'.Time last changed
:DATAI VAR=PRBASGN USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBASGN'.Assigned to
:DATAI VAR=PRBRPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBRPT'.Report prepared
:DATAI VAR=PRBSYMP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBSYMP'.Symptom string
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=NOTES.(No notes)
:LISTCOL VAR=NOTE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/NOTE'.Notes
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPRBW KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=WRKPRBW ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Problem
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATAI VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBID'.Problem ID
:DATAI VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBSTS'.Status
:DATAI VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBTEXT'.Problem
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101' HELP='WRKPRBW/OPT1'.Analyze problem
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102' HELP='WRKPRBW/OPT2'.Report problem
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103' HELP='WRKPRBW/OPT3'.Display problem details
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104' HELP='WRKPRBW/OPT4'.Enter text about the problem
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='RETURN 105' HELP='WRKPRBW/OPT5'.Close problem
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=PRBNOTE KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=PRBNOTE ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Enter Text About the Problem
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBID'.Problem ID
:DATAI VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBTEXT'.Problem
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type text, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=NEWNOTE USAGE=INOUT CSRLOC HELP='FLD/NEWNOTE'.Text
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=ANZPRB1 KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=ANZPRB1 ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Analyze a New Problem
:MENU DEPTH='*' OPTIONS=OPTION.Select the area the problem is in:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 201' HELP='ANZPRB1/OPT1'.A job or program ended, looped or waited
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 202' HELP='ANZPRB1/OPT2'.A message was shown
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 203' HELP='ANZPRB1/OPT3'.A display, printer, tape, optical or disk device
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 204' HELP='ANZPRB1/OPT4'.Communications or a remote system
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='RETURN 205' HELP='ANZPRB1/OPT5'.Performance
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=ANZPRB2 KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=ANZPRB2 ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Describe the Problem
:TOPINST.Type choices, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=ANZMSGID USAGE=INOUT CSRLOC HELP='FLD/ANZMSGID'.Message identifier
:DATAI VAR=ANZOBJ USAGE=INOUT HELP='FLD/ANZOBJ'.Job, program, device or line
:DATAI VAR=ANZSTOP USAGE=INOUT HELP='FLD/ANZSTOP'.Stops your work (Y, N)
:DATAI VAR=ANZTEXT USAGE=INOUT HELP='FLD/ANZTEXT'.Description
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=ANZPRB3 KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=ANZPRB3 ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Problem Analysis Complete
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATAI VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBID'.Problem ID
:DATAI VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBSTS'.Status
:DATAI VAR=PRBSYMP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRBSYMP'.Symptom string
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKPRB.Work with Problems - Help
:P.The problems the system logged on its own (severe operator messages,
hardware failures, dumps) and the ones problem analysis created, newest
first. Option 8 analyzes one or reports it to the service provider.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPRB.Display Problem Details - Help
:P.Everything the problem log holds of one problem: where it came from,
its status, the symptom string analysis built, and the notes added to it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKPRBW.Work with Problem - Help
:P.Analysis marks an opened problem ready to report. Reporting prepares
the report the service provider receives; with no connection to one, the
report is kept and the problem stays prepared.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=PRBNOTE.Enter Text - Help
:P.The text is added to the problem's notes and goes with its report.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=ANZPRB1.Analyze a New Problem - Help
:P.Choose the area that best fits what went wrong. The next panel asks
for what identifies it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=ANZPRB2.Describe the Problem - Help
:P.Give the message identifier when a message was shown, and the job,
program, device or line involved. The description is the problem's text.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=ANZPRB3.Problem Analysis Complete - Help
:P.The problem is in the problem log, ready to report. WRKPRB shows it.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/PBKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Report prepared problems
:PD.Report prepared problems.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPRB/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBID'.Problem ID
:P.The problem ID of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBSTS'.Status
:P.The status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBTEXT'.Problem Description
:P.The problem Description of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPRB/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.2=Change
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to change it.
:PT.4=Delete
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to delete it.
:PT.5=Display details
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display details it.
:PT.6=Print details
:PD.Type 6 next to an entry and press Enter to print details it.
:PT.8=Work with problem
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to work with problem it.
:PT.9=Work with alerts
:PD.Type 9 next to an entry and press Enter to work with alerts it.
:PT.12=Enter text
:PD.Type 12 next to an entry and press Enter to enter text it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/DSKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBTYPE'.Problem type
:P.The problem type shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBSEV'.Severity
:P.A message severity from 0 to 99. Higher numbers mean more serious
conditions.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBREF'.Reference code
:P.The reference code shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBRSRC'.Resource name
:P.The hardware resource name, as WRKHDWRSC shows it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBSYS'.Origin system
:P.The origin system shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBODATE'.Date opened
:P.The date opened shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBOTIME'.Time opened
:P.The time opened shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBCDATE'.Date last changed
:P.The date last changed shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBCTIME'.Time last changed
:P.The time last changed shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBASGN'.Assigned to
:P.The assigned to shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBRPT'.Report prepared
:P.The report prepared shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRBSYMP'.Symptom string
:P.The symptom string shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NOTE'.Notes
:P.The notes of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MNKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPRBW/OPT1'.Analyze problem
:P.Option 1. Analyze problem.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPRBW/OPT2'.Report problem
:P.Option 2. Report problem.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPRBW/OPT3'.Display problem details
:P.Option 3. Display problem details.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPRBW/OPT4'.Enter text about the problem
:P.Option 4. Enter text about the problem.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPRBW/OPT5'.Close problem
:P.Option 5. Close problem.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NEWNOTE'.Text
:P.Type the text.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ANZPRB1/OPT1'.A job or program ended, looped or waited
:P.Option 1. A job or program ended, looped or waited.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ANZPRB1/OPT2'.A message was shown
:P.Option 2. A message was shown.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ANZPRB1/OPT3'.A display, printer, tape, optical or disk device
:P.Option 3. A display, printer, tape, optical or disk device.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ANZPRB1/OPT4'.Communications or a remote system
:P.Option 4. Communications or a remote system.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ANZPRB1/OPT5'.Performance
:P.Option 5. Performance.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ANZMSGID'.Message identifier
:P.A message identifier&colon. three letters and four hexadecimal
digits, CPF1234 for example.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ANZOBJ'.Job, program, device or line
:P.Type the job, program, device or line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ANZSTOP'.Stops your work (Y, N)
:P.Type the stops your work (Y, N).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ANZTEXT'.Description
:P.Type the description.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
